      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "せっかくオルデリオンに療養にきたというのに……。\r\n申し訳なく思います。",
        "official_en": "It pains me to see you suffer so...especially considering you came all this way to Olderion.",
        "real_en": "You came all the way to Olderion to recuperate, and yet... I'm sorry."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
