      "text": {
        "jp": "オルデリオンの水は美しく澄んでいるので\r\n療養には最高の場所だったのですが……。",
        "official_en": "Olderion’s water, as you know, is pure and clean. It is an ideal place for her to recuperate. Or rather, it <text style=\"italic\">was</> ideal...",
        "real_en": "Olderion's waters are clear and pure, so this should have been the perfect place for her to recover..."
